{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/1670e0281155fe14642beb3f3a5c35fc.avif?t=1770638349\" width=1540 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>psychological horror puzzle</strong> about an strange VHS tape that captured a disturbingly realistic ritual.<br>Each viewing changes what happens on screen. Notice these changes, figure out what they mean and see if you can rewrite the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/8b2cd574932babd4677ab33f3dc48e0f.poster.avif?t=1770638349\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/8b2cd574932babd4677ab33f3dc48e0f.webm?t=1770638349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/8b2cd574932babd4677ab33f3dc48e0f.mp4?t=1770638349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the executioner, you\u2019re the <strong>victim.</strong><br>Use spatial audio to identify which victim you are and make sure the recording doesn\u2019t end too soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/5dd2ac1385a6ef5ca660ba76eea9350f.avif?t=1770638349\" width=1540 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rearrange the footage:</strong><br>What happened at 1:40?<br>Did the radio turn on, or did the revolver misfire?<br>But don\u2019t think you can control everything. The tape has its own plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/3db284ba9e84bbf0efbf2f869ac2c505.poster.avif?t=1770638349\" width=614 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/3db284ba9e84bbf0efbf2f869ac2c505.webm?t=1770638349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/3db284ba9e84bbf0efbf2f869ac2c505.mp4?t=1770638349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/extras/1b5ca37c2ee2a7826118bc50ebb02cc3.avif?t=1770638349\" width=1540 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly recreated VHS aesthetics: noise, distortion, and analog sound - all working together to create terrifying realism.<br>This is not a horror about blood or jump scares.<br>Fear hides in the details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric PSX-style visuals with VHS look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDirector\u2019s\u201d gameplay - rearrange events inside the tape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature horror that relies on realism, not jump scares</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672920?t=1770638349","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672920?t=1770638349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672920/3362a1373eebf6a77f71c9371997858765f1d4f9/c